OL,3,ANvidia shares slip as Trump's role in
OL,4,AJensen Huang's comeback questioned by
OL,5,AUS politicians
OL,6,
OL,7,FShares in tech giant Nvidia slip as US
OL,8,Fmarkets reopen, reversing some of the
OL,9,Fmassive gains made after Jensen Huang's
OL,10,Freturn as boss was announced on Monday
OL,12,FIt comes as President Trump's role in
OL,13,FHuang's comeback is questioned by some
OL,14,FUS politicians on both sides - what are
OL,15,Fthey saying?
OL,17,FTrump says he "made the deal" to bring
OL,18,FHuang back to the AI giant - but one
OL,19,Fsenior Democrat tells the BBC: "Under
OL,20,Fno circumstances should a president of
OL,21,Fthe United States be meddling in a
OL,22,Fcorporate board of directors' decision"
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
